  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7FSLYtk.png\" alt=\"Simply Swords 横幅\" width=\"1152\" height=\"312\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-skills\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/TDHaFqs.png\" alt=\"尝试 Simply Skills\" width=\"1152\" height=\"312\"></a><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eOWyCv6.png\" alt=\"武器变体\" width=\"1152\" height=\"648\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iduZbq5.png\" alt=\"独特武器\" width=\"1152\" height=\"648\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wNQ0qRk.png\" alt=\"模组支持\" width=\"1152\" height=\"648\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8N3BDbZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"152\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/H8BUkyQ.png\" alt=\"Better Combat 支持\" width=\"1152\" height=\"312\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8N3BDbZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"152\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WfWziAG.png\" alt=\"Patchouli 支持\" width=\"1152\" height=\"312\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8N3BDbZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"152\"></a><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hHoFbQt.png\" alt=\"额外支持\" width=\"1152\" height=\"312\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/knaves-needs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/n4a4oE0.png\" alt=\"Knaves Needs 扩展包\" width=\"1152\" height=\"312\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-more\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kZgkBV3.gif\" alt=\"Simply More 扩展包\" width=\"1152\" height=\"312\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/s9OPf1J.png\" alt=\"需要 Architectury &amp; Cloth Config\" width=\"1152\" height=\"312\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>额外内置支持</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mythicmetals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mythic Metals</a>&nbsp; |&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gobber-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gobber</a>&nbsp; |&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/levelz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LevelZ</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>额外支持</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Forbidden &amp; Arcanus | Twilight Forest | The Undergarden | Blue Skies | Plus The End<br>通过 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/knaves-needs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Knaves Needs</a> (由 KodoDenka 制作)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">通过 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-more\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simply More</a> (由 Rosemary__Thyme 制作) 添加 10 多种武器类型和 26 种以上的独特武器</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">更喜欢不同的外观？</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/simply-swords-classic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simply Swords Classic（经典 3D 模型）</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/yourscraft/files/all\" rel=\"nofollow\">Yourscraft 资源包 + Simply Swords 扩展包</a> (由 Manos_Of_Fate 制作)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/armaments-of-legend\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Armaments of Legend 资源包</a> (由 Count_Sjorn_Paradox 制作)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">Timefall 开发的其他模组</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golden-steak\" rel=\"nofollow\">Golden Steak</a>&nbsp;- 添加金色牛排和附魔金色牛排<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mcdw\" rel=\"nofollow\">MC Dungeons 武器</a>&nbsp;- 将《我的世界：地下城》的武器带入原版《我的世界》<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mcdar\" rel=\"nofollow\">MC Dungeons 神器</a>&nbsp;- 将《我的世界：地下城》的神器带入原版《我的世界》<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mcda\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MC Dungeons 护甲</a> - 将《我的世界：地下城》的护甲带入原版《我的世界》<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mcsa\" rel=\"nofollow\">MC 故事模式护甲</a>&nbsp;- 将《我的世界：故事模式》的护甲套装带入原版《我的世界》<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/save-gear-on-death\" rel=\"nofollow\">死亡保留装备</a>&nbsp;- 介于“保留物品栏”开启与关闭之间的折中方案<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/headshot-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">爆头 [Forge]</a>&nbsp;- 允许玩家和部分生物被爆头<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mob-summoning\" rel=\"nofollow\">生物召唤</a>&nbsp;- 召唤生物与你并肩作战<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diamond-shards-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">钻石碎片</a>&nbsp;- 将钻石分解为九块碎片。非常适合基于钻石的经济系统<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">战利品配置</a>&nbsp;- 完全自定义《我的世界》的战利品表<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/interchangeable\" rel=\"nofollow\">可互换配方</a>&nbsp;- 根据配置文件，允许在合成配方中互换输入物品的模组</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-skills\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simply Skills</a> - 一款适用于 Fabric 的全面技能树模组</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>想在好友服务器上游玩 Simply Swords 吗？不妨考虑一下 BisectHosting 提供的服务器！它们已经配置好，开箱即用！<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fTimefall\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/9deaa8f0-11c2-41f1-8